  "description": {
    "text": "The second POP Series set, 17 cards Pokémon Organized Play gave out in packs at its leagues and tournaments from August 2005 to April 2006.\n\nEvery card in the packs is non-holo, Celebi ex too. Holo copies came later in shop products: Venusaur in EX Holon Phantoms blisters (May 2006), Pidgeot and Tauros in EX Crystal Guardians blisters (late August and early September 2006), Entei, Raikou and Suicune in Legendary Beasts blisters (October 2006), and Celebi ex in a bonus box (November 2006), a Trainer's Challenge set and the 2007 Spring Collector's Tins. The Taiwan PokéPark gave its visitors Chinese-language copies of Raikou, Entei, Suicune and Tauros, each on its own day between 18 and 22 September 2006."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "The POP Series 2 symbol, and a number out of 17"
  },
